  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>關於</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Winterly 是一款適用於 Fabric 加載器的 Minecraft 模組。本模組圍繞冬季與節慶主題設計，這個簡約的模組將添加可供建造的裝飾物與可穿戴的造型配件，例如聖誕帽或聖誕樹下的禮物。本專案曾參與 2021 年 WinterJam 活動。</span><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><br></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/DcemWeskeZ\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v2/assets/cozy/social/discord-plural_64h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"\" width=\"222\" height=\"64\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fwinterly\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v2/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_64h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"\" width=\"192\" height=\"64\"></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zRirSaD.png\" alt=\"圖片\" width=\"1544\" height=\"595\"></span></p>",
